idiaries, provides educational and value-added telecommunication services in the People's Republic of China. It operates through four segments: Educational Services and Test Preparation Courses; Private Label Products and Livestreaming E-Commerce; Overseas Study Consulting Services; and Educational Materials and Distribution. The company offers test preparation courses to students taking language and entrance exams used by educational institutions. It also provides non-academic tutoring courses; intelligent learning systems and devices to offer a digital learning experience for students; and overseas studies consulting services. In addition, the company develops and edits educational materials for language training and test preparation; online education services through the Koolearn.com platform; sells private label products; and engages in livestreaming e-commerce business. Further, it offers educational programs, services, and products to students through schools, learning centers, and bookstores, as well as through its online learning platforms. It distributes its educational materials through various distribution channels, including bookstores and third-party distributors. New Oriental Education & Technology Group Inc. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Beijing, the People's Republic of China.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"8200","sic_desc":"Services-Educational Services","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Education & Training Services","mcap":8594839552,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"BEIJING","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"0531","cik":1372920,"state_inc":"E9","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-09"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"Yahoo quarterly income statement via yfinance (third-party fallback)","asof":"2026-10-09","q":[{"end":"2025-02-28","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.5,"eps_yoy":null